one: Your mission is to toss presents into chimneys, ensuring every one wakes up to the excitement of Christmas morning. Precision and timing are key to spreading holiday cheer!\n\nRide the Sleigh: Glide through snowy landscapes atop Santa\u2019s sleigh, pulled by faithful reindeer. Soar across rooftops, navigating through festive winter scenes that bring the holiday spirit to life.\n\nOvercome Challenges: Watch out for obstacles like blizzards and cheeky snowbirds that can disrupt your deliveries. Stay focused to ensure no child is left without a gift!\n\nEarn Points and Rewards: Every successful gift delivery earns you points. Aim for high scores as you master the art of Santa\u2019s gift toss and unlock festive surprises along the way.\n\nFestive Atmosphere: Immerse yourself in a world of dazzling visuals, cheerful holiday music, and intuitive VR controls, making this a magical.\n\nPerfect for Family Fun: Whether playing solo or sharing the joy with friends and family, Santa's Gift Toss is the ultimate holiday VR game to celebrate the Christmas spirit.", "short_description": "Santa's Gift Tooss is a delightful VR game on Meta Quest where you become Santa Claus. Your mission is to deliver gifts to every one by tossing presents into chimneys on Christmas Eve."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/privacypolicyforsantasgifttoos/trang-ch%E1%BB%A7", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Jone Sei", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/sei-vr-santasgifttoss/trang-ch%E1%BB%A7", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2691890164460465"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "re